WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2 - Scene 27h: Adel's Defeat and Ultimecia's Possession
Duration: ~9 seconds
Lunatic Pandora Interior - The Turning Point
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Sorceress Adel staggers backward from the party's final attacks. Her massive red-orange 
frame convulses. The power that sustained her begins to fail.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Adel crumbles to her knees, then collapses entirely. Her enormous body deteriorates as she 
falls, disintegrating into ethereal particles and fading light. The ancient Sorceress is 
finally destroyed, after centuries of imprisonment.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rinoa falls from where Adel held her, collapsing to the chamber floor. The party rushes to 
help her. She is freed from Adel's junction and begins to regain consciousness. Relief 
washes over the team — they have saved their companion. But in the shadows of the Lunatic 
Pandora, a new and greater threat emerges. Ultimecia, the future Sorceress who has been 
orchestrating all events from her hidden place outside of time itself, possesses Rinoa — 
making her the vessel for the terrible Time Compression that will now begin.
